17 Section 6. There is appropriated four million six
18 hundred forty thousand six hundred thirty-one dollars
19 ($4,640,631.00) from the public school foundation program
20 account to the department of education-school finance for
21 career and technical education supplies, equipment and
22 replacement payments to school districts made necessary by
23 the amendments enacted in this act. This appropriation
10 HB0235

2025 STATE OF WYOMING 25LSO-0685
1 shall be for the period beginning July 1, 2025 and ending
2 June 30, 2026. This appropriation shall not be transferred
3 or expended for any other purpose and any unexpended,
4 unobligated funds remaining from this appropriation shall
5 revert as provided by law on June 30, 2026. It is the
6 intent of the legislature that this appropriation be
7 included in the standard budget for the department of
8 education-school finance for the immediately succeeding
9 fiscal biennium.
10
11 Section 7. This act is effective July 1, 2025.
